  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>הַקּוֹנֶה הִתְחַבֵּט:</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּיִת עִם יַצִּיעַ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">זֶה נֶכֶס מַפְתִּיעַ -</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אָז כַּמָּה אַצִּיעַ?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>הַמּוֹכֵר הִתְלַבֵּט:</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כַּמָּה אֲבַקֵּשׁ?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַסֶּה לְגַשֵּׁשׁ -</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כַּמָּה לָאִישׁ יֵשׁ.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>דַּבֵּר פָּחוֹת - הַקְשֵׁב יוֹתֵר</b><strong data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"198\">.</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">במשא ומתן, מי שמדבר פחות - שומע יותר.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\nכשאתה שואל ושותק, הצד השני ממלא את השתיקה במידע, ולעיתים גם בויתור.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לפעמים המילים החזקות ביותר הן דווקא השתיקה המחושבת.</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ככל שאתה לוחץ - הצד השני נסגר; ככל שאתה מרפה - הוא נפתח.</span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p data-end=\"186\" data-start=\"67\"><strong data-end=\"122\" data-start=\"67\">\"וַיִּהְיוּ חַיֵּי שָׂרָה\" = 570 = \"עֹבֵר לַסֹּחֵר\"</strong><br data-end=\"125\" data-start=\"122\" /></p><p>בכסף ארבע מאות שקלים&nbsp;<em data-end=\"154\" data-start=\"138\">עֹבֵר לַסֹּחֵר</em> – קנה אברהם את הקבר במות שרה..</p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></p></span><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><b>תוֹשָׁב</b>&nbsp;' / '</span><span><b style=\"background-color: white;\">תוֹתָב</b><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><br /></span></span></span></span></span>❖ יושב באופן קבוע, ממלא את המקום - שן תותבת</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>מִבְחַר</b>' / '<b>שְׁפַר</b>'<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;הכי טוב, הנבחר - המשופר</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>'<b>זָקֵן</b>' / '<b>סִיב</b>'<br /></span>❖ מבוגר, ישיש - איש שיבה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>הַטִּי</b>' / '<b>אַרְכִּינִי</b>'<br /></span></span></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;לכופף, להטות - להרכין</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><b style=\"background-color: white;\">נַּעֲרָה</b><span style=\"background-color: white;\">' / '</span><b style=\"background-color: white;\">עוּלֵימְתָא</b><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><br /></span></span></span>❖ בחורה צעירה - עלמה</span></li></ol><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/15fe203cd5d2963429.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/4b148f1d0da1934fa4.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"מוסכניק מחייך חיוך ערמומי, לבוש סרבל כחול ומחזיק מפתח שוודי, עומד במוסך ליד רכב מורם על ליפט\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/4b148f1d0da1934fa4.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; “אל תדאג, נסתדר” =<br data-end=\"440\" data-start=\"437\" />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; אתה תדאג, והוא יסתדר. 😎</span></div></div></div>"
}
